::  c3: gain_atom_skin / lose_atom_skin through ?#(@aura wing) under ?: (mod.rs ~9763, ~10078):
::  noun, atom (any aura and fitz+max), cell, face, fork, hint and hold refs.
|%
+$  num  @ud
++  main
  |=  [a=* b=@ud c=$@(@ux [p=@ q=@]) d=(list @) e=[f=@ g=@] h=[i=[j=@ k=@] l=@t] n=num]
  :*  !>(?:(?#(@ a) a a))
      !>(?:(?#(@ud a) a a))
      !>(?:(?#(@ b) b !!))
      !>(?:(?#(@u b) b !!))
      !>(?:(?#(@udx b) b !!))
      !>(?:(?#(@ c) c c))
      !>(?:(?#(@ d) d d))
      !>(?:(?#(@ e) !! e))
      !>(?:(?#(@ i.h) !! h))
      !>(?:(?#(@t l.h) h !!))
      !>(?:(?#(@ta l.h) h !!))
      !>(?:(?#(@ n) n !!))
      !>(?:(?#(@ t.+.d) d d))
  ==
--
